OL,3,A'A giant leap forward': Nasa launches
OL,4,Apowerful new space telescope
OL,5,
OL,6,FNasa's powerful next-generation
OL,7,Ftelescope has blasted off into space
OL,8,Ffrom its launchpad in Florida, with a
OL,9,Fmission to explore dark energy, black
OL,10,Fholes and other mysteries of the
OL,11,FUniverse.
OL,13,FThe Nancy Grace Roman telescope will
OL,14,Fcapture vast panoramic views of space,
OL,15,Fwith a field of vision 100 times larger
OL,16,Fthan both the Hubble and James Webb
OL,17,Fspace telescopes, Nasa says.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
