OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'A giant leap forward': Nasa launches
OL,4,Apowerful new space telescope
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mission begins with a 100-day
OL,7,Fjourney to a vantage point roughly one
OL,8,Fmillion miles from Earth, where the
OL,9,Ftelescope will then start charting
OL,10,Fplanets outside our solar system, known
OL,11,Fas exoplanets.
OL,13,F"Roman is going to change the way we
OL,14,Flook at the Universe," said Nicky Fox,
OL,15,Fa Nasa administrator.
